[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:08.62]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:13.82]left a single note and went on their way
[00:19.66]I never got their name until the credits
[00:23.22]now it plays here every single day
[00:29.06]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:33.50]One note at a time
[00:37.66]from people passing through
[00:40.34]a name beside a line
[00:42.64]and part of it is you
[00:48.88]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
